window.THREADS["125462"] = {"tid": "125462", "title": "细说丁丁（二）中国真的有那么多18吗", "category": "交流", "typeid": "7", "author": "ainvrenpy", "uid": "566886", "date": "2023-10-12 18:45:20", "views": 97962, "replies": 44, "pages_fetched": 3, "post_count": 45, "cover": "assets/images/125462/TrRuGjf.jpg", "all_images": ["assets/images/125462/TrRuGjf.jpg", "assets/images/125462/MZpcJWA.jpg", "assets/images/125462/NmtSpMo.jpg", "assets/images/125462/Rw1JfOR.jpg", "assets/images/125462/f7SIeDK.jpg", "assets/images/125462/Q8aH8Cc.jpg", "assets/images/125462/lt4DXPi.jpg", "assets/images/125462/91JD8ud.jpg", "assets/images/125462/m7M6r9b.jpg", "assets/images/125462/DmlFpyU.jpg", "assets/images/125462/W6CyicS.jpg"], "pan": [], "pan_floor": [], "article": {"author": "ainvrenpy", "uid": "566886", "avatar": "", "date": "2023-10-12 18:45:20", "html": "<i class=\"pstatus\"> 本帖最後由 ainvrenpy 於 2023-11-2 15:24 編輯 </i><br />\n<br />\n相信大家在逛各种论坛时，在相关话题下，总有很多人号称自己18cm，或者更长；几个关系比较要好的女网友，都不约而同的问我，真的有那么多18cm的吗？为什么她们一个也没遇见过？其实包括我在内的很多男网友，也是有这个疑问的，于是我就开始了这个调查，看看那些号称18甚至20+的人里，到底有多少是真正达到18cm的。<br />\n<br />\n首先我询问了一些在论坛上号称18及以上的人，下面就选择一些有代表性的对话内容给大家看看：<br />\nA：我只是说着好玩的。<font color=\"#ff8c0\">这样的人占了很大一部分。</font><br />\nB：我是从下面开始量的，这样量不正确吗？<font color=\"#ff8c00\">正确是从上面顶住耻骨量。</font><br />\nC：我和某某手机差不多，那手机应该有18吧？<font color=\"#ff8c00\">其实几乎所有的手机都没有18</font>。<br />\nD：我有16-18，状态好时就有18。<font color=\"#ff8c00\">这样说的人很多，这么大的偏差，应该是测量不标准造成的，但如果真是这样，就说明他开始有阳痿症状了；</font><br />\nE：好多女的都说我的大，<font color=\"#ff8c00\">女的有时只是说恭维话，很多女人对尺寸并没有概念，</font><br />\nF：每次女的都说好痛。<font color=\"#ff8c00\">一直把女生弄痛，只能说明技术差而已，很多尺寸小的一样能把女生弄痛。</font><br />\nG：女朋友给我量过，我有18，或者自己量过有18。<font color=\"#ff8c00\">这样说的男女也不少，但口说无凭。</font><br />\n……<br />\n从上面这些对话中，能很快知道ABC这三类的人并没有真正的18，直接淘汰；然后在剩下的这些人中，问能否验证，提供测量照片时，有的人就直接消失，有的人说回去拿尺子测量照了就发我看，然后也就杳无音信；当然，确实还是有一些人吧照片发给了我验证，同时我也在网上采集到了很多号称18以上的人的图片，在对这些照片验证过程中，有的能很容易就判断出他没有18，但有的照片就很具有迷惑新，一般人很难分辨，可谓是八仙过海，各显神通；千方百计要把自己弄成18，下面我们就来看看主要有以下几种作假方法：<br />\n<br />\n1.从下面开始量，就像我文章开始时说的那种，这种不要说18，20多都能量出来；这种方法可以增长3-6cm；<br />\n2.用拍摄技巧，让丁丁看上去很大，但就是不敢提供尺子测量的图；<br />\n3.用PS，有的PS丁丁，有的PS尺子，这个想要多大都可以P，哈哈；<br />\n4.不照出整个尺子的全部，只照出丁丁和尺子18标记的部分，这样看不见几厘米，丁丁就可能增长几厘米。<br />\n5.直接用网图；<br />\n<br />\n上面这些作假方法，比如容易甄别，通常叫他们多发几张，就会暴露。而下面这些作假方法就很难判断了，很容易上当，以为是真正的18，但其实并不是，下面我们就来看看这些作假的方法，为了便于各位更直观的了解，我用了一个长9.5cm，龟头宽2.4cm的玩具做为参考演示：<br />\n<font style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"assets/images/125462/TrRuGjf.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"></font><br />\n6.用软尺测量时，由于没法固定造成的松弛，测量呈弧线，从而得到的读数偏大0.5-2cm<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/125462/MZpcJWA.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n7.尺子斜着量，分为上下斜，左右斜，倾斜的度数越大，尺寸显示的数值就越长，这样能增加0.5-3cm；<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/125462/NmtSpMo.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"> <img src=\"assets/images/125462/Rw1JfOR.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n7.利用尺子和丁丁间的角度误差，从尺子的前方进行观看，这样能增加0.5-2cm左右；<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/125462/f7SIeDK.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n8.利用物体间的距离透视误差，远小近大，这样长和宽都可以增加不少，做的心有多大，丁丁就有多大。<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/125462/Q8aH8Cc.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n了解了各种作假的方法，就能很容易判断丁丁到底有没有18，几年间差不多<font color=\"#ff0000\">验证了400多个号称18以上的，但真正能确定超过18cm的只有8人</font>，所以网上看见的号称18以上的，绝大多数都是假的。而且，在上一篇文章中说过，采集了1000多人的图片数据，发现不管是任何尺寸，85%以上的人都会将自己的尺寸说长说粗，见过12号称14的，11号称13的，15号称17的，最夸张的是12号称18，17号称23的等等。这里再次说一下，<font color=\"#ff0000\">只有标准测量，才是丁丁能进入阴道的有效长度</font>，如图所示：<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/125462/lt4DXPi.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n任何事情都要讲公平，公正，你从蛋开始量。13说自己18，很多真正13的兄弟看了，就自卑，这样很不好，希望这些兄弟看了不要自卑，大尺寸的远远没你们看见的那么多。<br />\n<br />\n这里顺带说一下粗度的问题，在采集过程中，也有很多人号称自己很粗，有5cm以上，验证时，大多数是使用了上面第8种距离透视误差，远小近大的方法，实际上比5cm细很多，还有人用游标卡尺测量证明自己有5cm，但其实也是用了镜头的距离透视误差，<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/125462/91JD8ud.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n<br />\n现在问题来了，为什么会有这么多人自欺欺人，千方百计地冒充18cm呢？原因只有一个，为了取悦女人，获得女人的青睐，我就知道有2个女网友，因为对方号称18cm而同意约的，当然结果是上当……那女人为什么喜欢更长的丁丁呢？女人到底喜欢多长的丁丁呢？<font color=\"#333333\"><font face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><font style=\"font-size:13px\">敬请期待下文讲解：</font></font></font><font face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#ff0000\"><font style=\"font-size:13px\">细说丁丁（三）女人最喜欢的丁丁尺寸</font></font></font><br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<a href=\"index.html#tid=125349\">细说丁丁（一）中国丁丁真正的尺寸</a><br />\n<br />\n<a href=\"index.html#tid=125740\">细说丁丁（三）女人最喜欢的丁丁尺寸</a><br />\n<br />\n<a href=\"index.html#tid=126210\">细说丁丁（四）最适合女人的丁丁尺寸</a><br />\n<br />\n<a href=\"index.html#tid=126447\">细说丁丁（五）丁丁中的战斗丁</a><br />\n<br />\n补充一张日本片商给男优评级的图<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/125462/m7M6r9b.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />", "images": ["assets/images/125462/TrRuGjf.jpg", "assets/images/125462/MZpcJWA.jpg", "assets/images/125462/NmtSpMo.jpg", "assets/images/125462/Rw1JfOR.jpg", "assets/images/125462/f7SIeDK.jpg", "assets/images/125462/Q8aH8Cc.jpg", "assets/images/125462/lt4DXPi.jpg", "assets/images/125462/91JD8ud.jpg", "assets/images/125462/m7M6r9b.jpg"]}, "comments": [{"floor": 2, "author": "大树先森", "uid": "356407", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "我13厘米 直径4.3，我买套都要买大号。<br />\n之前见到有个帖子发量丁丁的 只从蛋蛋的位置开始量，<br />\n如果这样我觉得我又能增加2厘米了。哈哈哈。", "images": []}, {"floor": 3, "author": "xzc2000", "uid": "312531", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "我比我的iphone 12promax 短个0.5左右吧，在澡堂目测是中上等，但比我大的也确实挺常见", "images": []}, {"floor": 4, "author": "ALLDONE", "uid": "332368", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "期待第三集", "images": []}, {"floor": 5, "author": "白歌", "uid": "427833", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "开什么玩笑 当然没有了！我量过很多次了，就17CM！", "images": []}, {"floor": 6, "author": "DMC", "uid": "515182", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "楼主是个人才，看过这么多同性的小弟，哈哈哈哈，我反正实事求是，长12.8，粗4，我老婆很满意~~~", "images": []}, {"floor": 7, "author": "3222594268", "uid": "374527", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "看了昨天的文章有点自卑，今天看了楼主的文章，感觉又自信了", "images": []}, {"floor": 8, "author": "xuxu25", "uid": "495582", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "<img src=\"static/image/smiley/javbus/1.png\" smilieid=\"86\" border=\"0\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"static/image/smiley/javbus/1.png\" smilieid=\"86\" border=\"0\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"static/image/smiley/javbus/1.png\" smilieid=\"86\" border=\"0\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" alt=\"\" />以前上学那会和同学比过，他是细长细长的，我是又短又粗<img src=\"static/image/smiley/javbus/23.png\" smilieid=\"101\" border=\"0\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"static/image/smiley/javbus/23.png\" smilieid=\"101\" border=\"0\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" alt=\"\" />，", "images": []}, {"floor": 9, "author": "fishandchips", "uid": "533009", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "我觉得只要到男澡堂统计一下就行了，如果觉得统计一次不准确，那就一个月30天，每天中午晚上各统计一次，这应该接近生活中的真实情况了吧，事实上，但凡经常去澡堂的，15~16厘米就是顶级水准了！平常见的最多的就是10厘米上下的。", "images": []}, {"floor": 10, "author": "擎隆聖黛", "uid": "332486", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "本来没专门考究这个事，看了上一篇文章特意弄硬拿尺子量了一下，长13，直径3.5", "images": []}, {"floor": 11, "author": "malingxie01", "uid": "327536", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "反正我弯钩的话也是用软尺在上面测的，从蛋测量的话肯定都会长的。。", "images": []}, {"floor": 12, "author": "ainvrenpy", "uid": "566886", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "<div class=\"quote\"><blockquote><font size=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.javbus.com/forum/forum.php?mod=redirect&amp;goto=findpost&amp;pid=3105447&amp;ptid=125462\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#999999\">fishandchips 發表於 2023-10-12 19:15</font></a></font><br />\n我觉得只要到男澡堂统计一下就行了，如果觉得统计一次不准确，那就一个月30天，每天中午晚上各统计一次，这 ...</blockquote></div><br />\n你考虑过这个问题没有，就是澡堂里的人是都勃起的吗？就算都勃起了，你能看出准确的长度吗？你是要挨个去测量吗？你这个方法的可行性太差了，人家会把你当变态或者玻璃吧，", "images": []}, {"floor": 13, "author": "anheipohuain", "uid": "76904", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "我不信！用我的尺子量出来是20cm！<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/125462/DmlFpyU.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\">", "images": ["assets/images/125462/DmlFpyU.jpg"]}, {"floor": 14, "author": "psychok", "uid": "263536", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "安排上<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/125462/W6CyicS.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\">", "images": ["assets/images/125462/W6CyicS.jpg"]}, {"floor": 15, "author": "samon", "uid": "142133", "avatar": "", "date": "共 11 頁", "html": "我的丁丁大到，去外面玩，很少有妹子能找两次，因为她们不接了！！！ 很苦恼，实际可能在16cm左右，状态好往前顶能有18", "images": []}, {"floor": 16, "author": "799952", "uid": "424723", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "楼主，请问要如何做到标准测量？看了帖子中所说还是有点不太理解", "images": []}, {"floor": 17, "author": "lsj9527", "uid": "307294", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "下次能不能换个话题？测量一下别的", "images": []}, {"floor": 18, "author": "A界福尔摩斯", "uid": "432037", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "<img src=\"static/image/smiley/javbus/17.png\" smilieid=\"94\" border=\"0\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" alt=\"\" />没有尺子。。更没有游标。。 能不能说一个大概能判断的方法。。。&nbsp;&nbsp;反正打飞机的时候 研究过。 我自己是一握+4指的长度。。不知道是多长 估计有个十二三四吧&nbsp;&nbsp;。。也许。。 反正和女伴我是够用了。。<br />\n女性的深度也就一指够到低了&nbsp;&nbsp;不用太在乎长度。 技巧更重要。", "images": []}, {"floor": 19, "author": "ainvrenpy", "uid": "566886", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "<div class=\"quote\"><blockquote><font size=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.javbus.com/forum/forum.php?mod=redirect&amp;goto=findpost&amp;pid=3105519&amp;ptid=125462\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#999999\">samon 發表於 2023-10-12 19:39</font></a></font><br />\n我的丁丁大到，去外面玩，很少有妹子能找两次，因为她们不接了！！！ 很苦恼，实际可能在16cm左右，状态好 ...</blockquote></div><br />\n文章中我也提到，像你这样说法的人不少，因为我是做数据的，所以不可能只凭说，一般都要以标准的测量图为准，很多说看状态的人，没一个提供了状态好时，18的测量图哦。", "images": []}, {"floor": 20, "author": "charduo", "uid": "395663", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "<div class=\"quote\"><blockquote><font size=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.javbus.com/forum/forum.php?mod=redirect&amp;goto=findpost&amp;pid=3105447&amp;ptid=125462\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#999999\">fishandchips 發表於 2023-10-12 19:15</font></a></font><br />\n我觉得只要到男澡堂统计一下就行了，如果觉得统计一次不准确，那就一个月30天，每天中午晚上各统计一次，这 ...</blockquote></div><br />\n额。。。澡堂子里都是硬的？？这怕是gay堂子。。。。哈哈哈哈（狗头）", "images": []}, {"floor": 21, "author": "笠笠笠", "uid": "491487", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "学会了，这就砍下来量<img src=\"static/image/smiley/javbus/43.png\" smilieid=\"123\" border=\"0\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" alt=\"\" />", "images": []}, {"floor": 22, "author": "superf", "uid": "489600", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "楼主太专业了", "images": []}, {"floor": 23, "author": "yogalin", "uid": "567524", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "成年后怎么增粗增长", "images": []}, {"floor": 24, "author": "133378", "uid": "448052", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "网络上个个都是嫪毐，现实中的吉尔短小阳痿男。网络上人均月薪八万，现实中的屌丝泡面王子", "images": []}, {"floor": 25, "author": "我来看看啊", "uid": "364880", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "我13到15吧？我记得之前好像试过，抵住根部，比苹果11长点？可能不太准吧。。。", "images": []}, {"floor": 26, "author": "萌新老司机", "uid": "314779", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "这是什么，我还以为是萝卜呢", "images": []}, {"floor": 27, "author": "linhaimir3", "uid": "261584", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "<div class=\"quote\"><blockquote><font size=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.javbus.com/forum/forum.php?mod=redirect&amp;goto=findpost&amp;pid=3105405&amp;ptid=125462\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#999999\">大树先森 發表於 2023-10-12 18:50</font></a></font><br />\n我13厘米 直径4.3，我买套都要买大号。<br />\n之前见到有个帖子发量丁丁的 只从蛋蛋的位置开始量，<br />\n如果这样我觉 ...</blockquote></div><br />\n顶着耻骨量，大部分人都是13cm，可惜那些短的不认，非要从蛋蛋那边量，干脆从膀胱那里开始量算了", "images": []}, {"floor": 28, "author": "哈利波特大", "uid": "54253", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "<div class=\"quote\"><blockquote><font size=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.javbus.com/forum/forum.php?mod=redirect&amp;goto=findpost&amp;pid=3105569&amp;ptid=125462\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#999999\">yogalin 發表於 2023-10-12 20:00</font></a></font><br />\n成年后怎么增粗增长</blockquote></div><br />\n运动减肥能让丁丁多露出来点也算是增长了，同时增强供血能力变硬一些，还是能有些效果的。至于其他的，估计也就手术能有真实效果了吧，这一般人真不建议尝试。。", "images": []}, {"floor": 29, "author": "jessicalove", "uid": "483466", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "我勃起才11，拖后腿了", "images": []}, {"floor": 30, "author": "ws786873", "uid": "99932", "avatar": "", "date": "共 11 頁", "html": "用游标卡尺量了下，长也就12左右吧，龟头夹住了有4.6宽", "images": []}, {"floor": 31, "author": "wcl333c", "uid": "177237", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "真的18的路过~", "images": []}, {"floor": 32, "author": "gdg", "uid": "395995", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "我的17/4.5吧。 <br />\n大有的时候也不好，碰到阴道浅的根本进不全。有些女的都不让我后入她，说是疼。", "images": []}, {"floor": 33, "author": "万花丛中一点绿", "uid": "503340", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "内地的生殖器崇拜太空白了。出发点还是为了让性更加和谐，比如尺寸 硬度如何让女性到达G点", "images": []}, {"floor": 34, "author": "做宝搞啊", "uid": "300172", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "到耻骨就行了，尺子拉到屁眼是有可能的，网上看到的大鸟，基本上都是15往上。一般肚子瘦会长一点，我很硬的时候也就14", "images": []}, {"floor": 35, "author": "nfzwy1234567", "uid": "464174", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "这种问题通过这种方式调查肯定不准的，就从片里的真实长度用眼估计吧", "images": []}, {"floor": 36, "author": "fanhuojingyin", "uid": "339239", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "我有一个同学，用2块钱买的小盒尺量丁丁，结果尺苗子没按住，歘（chua）的一下就回弹了，然后裤衩都没穿，捂着个手巾就去医院了", "images": []}, {"floor": 37, "author": "ainvrenpy", "uid": "566886", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "<div class=\"quote\"><blockquote><font size=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.javbus.com/forum/forum.php?mod=redirect&amp;goto=findpost&amp;pid=3105540&amp;ptid=125462\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#999999\">A界福尔摩斯 發表於 2023-10-12 19:48</font></a></font><br />\n没有尺子。。更没有游标。。 能不能说一个大概能判断的方法。。。&nbsp;&nbsp;反正打飞机的时候 研究过。 我 ...</blockquote></div><br />\n可以用手机，按照标准测量法的样子来进行测量，手机的尺寸，都能查到，所以可以大概推算出自己的尺寸。还有就是手一握是8cm左右，当然有的人手大手小，一手指是1.5cm左右，当然握的时候还是要从上面反握，这样才能顶住耻骨。但这些都只能是大概，太不准确了。", "images": []}, {"floor": 38, "author": "吾将上下而求索", "uid": "477365", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "今天是论吊大会？", "images": []}, {"floor": 39, "author": "1255277029", "uid": "280005", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "13CM正常吗", "images": []}, {"floor": 40, "author": "sd4587809", "uid": "552214", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "今天又学到了奇怪的知识，我去试试，看看我多长", "images": []}, {"floor": 41, "author": "sd4587809", "uid": "552214", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "<div class=\"quote\"><blockquote><font size=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.javbus.com/forum/forum.php?mod=redirect&amp;goto=findpost&amp;pid=3105741&amp;ptid=125462\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#999999\">1255277029 發表於 2023-10-12 21:19</font></a></font><br />\n13CM正常吗</blockquote></div><br />\n我个人认为，13是标准的，算是一个很平均的长度", "images": []}, {"floor": 42, "author": "xiaoxiaojiba", "uid": "414893", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "有时候状态好能16，一般也就12~13。现在不行了，现在年纪大连晨勃都没了", "images": []}, {"floor": 43, "author": "rotest0157", "uid": "314324", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "16+6.5飘过。", "images": []}, {"floor": 44, "author": "罪恶网管", "uid": "530221", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "15cm,從恥骨量的長度,遇過的都很滿意<img src=\"static/image/smiley/javbus/44.png\" smilieid=\"124\" border=\"0\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" alt=\"\" />", "images": []}, {"floor": 45, "author": "老街男孩123", "uid": "299865", "avatar": "", "date": "共 11 頁", "html": "<i class=\"pstatus\"> 本帖最後由 老街男孩123 於 2023-10-12 21:37 編輯 </i><br />\n<br />\n到底是顶着骨头还是顶着外面一层肉，顶着骨头的话能多出个1厘米不到。还有明显的龟头往下一截很明显的上翘，这有怎么算呢？具体度数不知道，但我肯定有20度+，", "images": []}]};
window.THREADS["168902"] = {"tid": "168902", "title": "分享我的巨乳巨臀炮友4：泳装", "category": "交流", "typeid": "7", "author": "freexzt", "uid": "613902", "date": "2026-3-23 17:10:07", "views": 111605, "replies": 14, "pages_fetched": 1, "post_count": 15, "cover": "assets/images/168902/aioEdUf.png", "all_images": ["assets/images/168902/aioEdUf.png", "assets/images/168902/K8ZgA1C.jpeg", "assets/images/168902/uFVkXVa.png", "assets/images/168902/w1eLn5f.png", "assets/images/168902/VPCv1Nv.png", "assets/images/168902/B51ySOL.png", "assets/images/168902/wnRnxbj.png", "assets/images/168902/Vghf86D.png", "assets/images/168902/gNUAdrh.png", "assets/images/168902/etNN1s8.png", "assets/images/168902/k2JqNW7.jpeg", "assets/images/168902/9ASTUCG.png", "assets/images/168902/ewgc2dt.png", "assets/images/168902/sKFl79S.png", "assets/images/168902/5XAheIg.png", "assets/images/168902/YhwLF73.jpeg", "assets/images/168902/QT5Clot.jpeg", "assets/images/168902/o9Yk65o.jpeg", "assets/images/168902/TusKGQp.jpeg", "assets/images/168902/uRdsQdA.png", "assets/images/168902/DNduP3M.jpeg", "assets/images/168902/xx944iz.jpeg", "assets/images/168902/puKIbs5.jpeg", "assets/images/168902/ITf7kn7.jpeg"], "pan": [], "pan_floor": [], "article": {"author": "freexzt", "uid": "613902", "avatar": "", "date": "2026-3-23 17:10:07", "html": "<i class=\"pstatus\"> 本帖最後由 freexzt 於 2026-3-25 08:41 編輯 </i><br />\n<br />\n大家有防骗意识是好事啊，但是也别草木皆兵了。这个帖子的照片都是首发，大家一起来打假。<br />\n如果有人有实锤哪张照片在其他地方先发过或者有AI生成的（除了那张我标明用AI美化的），我马上销号退网。<br />\n顺便说一下，现在AI生成没有这么真实。。。<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n介绍下女主：mint，常用ID：mintazure，15-20年初活跃于豆瓣和知乎，算个小网红吧。<br />\n20年后不玩了，并从广州搬到我的城市，之后成为我的固定球友。<br />\n在广州是舞蹈老师，在我这边做了一段时间健身教练，有固定男友后就没在意工作的事了。<br />\n<br />\n由于从不露脸，网友总结了一套分辨技巧：胸上2颗痣，后腰1颗痣，算是mint的水印了。<br />\n<br />\n胸围：中国穿75J，美国穿34H，她内衣现在都是我来买。臀围100+，胖的时候有105。<br />\n<br />\n我和很多人一样，比较虚荣，特别想买好看又暴露的衣服给女伴穿。所以我这几年最大的爱好就是买各种比基尼，并带着mint去三亚玩，每年都去了至少一次。。。<br />\n<br />\n今天先更新几套去年夏天拍的吧，都是原图直出，不知道大家最喜欢那套。<br />\n<br />\n1.椰子<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/aioEdUf.png\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n先来2张水印图吧，分别是胸和臀。<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/K8ZgA1C.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n为了防止有人说和之前的巨臀帖子不是同一人，我特意po了张背后的。<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/uFVkXVa.png\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n这套非常显胸大（虽然本来就大），因为颜色搭配好我就买了，价格很便宜。<br />\n其实她的腿也很好看，不过我是巨乳巨臀控，没什么感觉。<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/w1eLn5f.png\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\nmint身高173，在我们南方算高妹了<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/VPCv1Nv.png\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n2.Jennie同款<br />\n冷知识：痣在另外一边因为是前置自拍。。。<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/B51ySOL.png\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n这套不用说了，mint这么开放的人都不敢穿去公共泳池，简直就是行走的核弹<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/wnRnxbj.png\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n我也是花了好多经历才说服她穿去泳池，不得不说，真的很给我涨面子<br />\n<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/Vghf86D.png\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n这应该是布料最少的一件，其实不适合巨乳穿，大家可以去看下jennie穿的样子<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/gNUAdrh.png\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n从背后能看到的才是真正的巨乳<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/etNN1s8.png\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n3.爱心<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/k2JqNW7.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n这套我其实不是很喜欢，但是mint超爱<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/9ASTUCG.png\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n相对没有那么暴露，可以穿去海边<br />\n注意：下图用AI美化过。。。<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/ewgc2dt.png\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n4.奶牛<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/sKFl79S.png\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n这套我个人很喜欢，但是当时mint心情不好，不让我拍太多，有些可惜<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/5XAheIg.png\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n5.绿色<br />\n这组是为臀控准备的<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/YhwLF73.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/QT5Clot.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/o9Yk65o.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n6.连体泳衣<br />\n这些是她去游泳馆穿的，只能保守点<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/TusKGQp.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/uRdsQdA.png\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n这张是最近的，好像又变瘦了<br />\n<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/DNduP3M.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n按照惯例，最后几张事前图吧<br />\n<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/xx944iz.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n不在一起的时候，mint经常发我性感照，还说只发给我一个人<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/puKIbs5.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n她太懂男人了，知道巨乳控需要什么<br />\n<br />\n<img src=\"assets/images/168902/ITf7kn7.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"gimg\" alt=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\"><br />\n<br />\n最后，祝大家晚安<br />\n<br />\n之前发的：<br />\n<br />\n<a href=\"index.html#tid=168781\">分享我的大奶炮友</a><br />\n<br />\n<a href=\"index.html#tid=168845\">分享我的大奶炮友2：巨臀</a><br />\n<br />\n<a href=\"index.html#tid=168884\">分享我的巨乳炮友3：日常</a><br />\n<br />", "images": ["assets/images/168902/aioEdUf.png", "assets/images/168902/K8ZgA1C.jpeg", "assets/images/168902/uFVkXVa.png", "assets/images/168902/w1eLn5f.png", "assets/images/168902/VPCv1Nv.png", "assets/images/168902/B51ySOL.png", "assets/images/168902/wnRnxbj.png", "assets/images/168902/Vghf86D.png", "assets/images/168902/gNUAdrh.png", "assets/images/168902/etNN1s8.png", "assets/images/168902/k2JqNW7.jpeg", "assets/images/168902/9ASTUCG.png", "assets/images/168902/ewgc2dt.png", "assets/images/168902/sKFl79S.png", "assets/images/168902/5XAheIg.png", "assets/images/168902/YhwLF73.jpeg", "assets/images/168902/QT5Clot.jpeg", "assets/images/168902/o9Yk65o.jpeg", "assets/images/168902/TusKGQp.jpeg", "assets/images/168902/uRdsQdA.png", "assets/images/168902/DNduP3M.jpeg", "assets/images/168902/xx944iz.jpeg", "assets/images/168902/puKIbs5.jpeg", "assets/images/168902/ITf7kn7.jpeg"]}, "comments": [{"floor": 2, "author": "renfans_nick", "uid": "116779", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "好舒服啊 来交换吗兄弟", "images": []}, {"floor": 3, "author": "gg312", "uid": "333275", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "蹲到首发了，自然的胸型还是看着很舒服的。现在AI的发展真的是让人目不暇接，有热度就会有争议，是真还是假，咱这些观测者本来也看不到本来风光。", "images": []}, {"floor": 4, "author": "javbus1217", "uid": "569777", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "兄弟厉害啊，身材是极品，就是这比基尼的样式一言难尽", "images": []}, {"floor": 5, "author": "yogalin", "uid": "567524", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "从皮肤状态来看，绝对是真实的", "images": []}, {"floor": 6, "author": "牛牛要爆了", "uid": "595569", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "从后面都能看到的巨乳，羡慕麻了", "images": []}, {"floor": 7, "author": "jiushiniuli", "uid": "602778", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "我记得这个知乎退网是外语被抓，，不是抓的你把", "images": []}, {"floor": 8, "author": "TTright", "uid": "406462", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "又是让人羡慕的一天。兄弟吃的真不错", "images": []}, {"floor": 9, "author": "Mr.Bad", "uid": "411888", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "这奶子没有G也得有F", "images": []}, {"floor": 10, "author": "kellyhung123", "uid": "634288", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "身材好棒啊，丰乳肥臀啊，极品炮友哦", "images": []}, {"floor": 11, "author": "顺子不二", "uid": "588917", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "卧槽，太牛了，身材棒棒的，颜值也很高，操起来美滋滋", "images": []}, {"floor": 12, "author": "yjsyjs", "uid": "446709", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "看得我心痒痒啊", "images": []}, {"floor": 13, "author": "LBJ-23", "uid": "619313", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "老哥牛逼，好久没来一口气看完了4篇，真是太爽了。也别管人家的质疑，毕竟啥人都有，大部分人都是爱看的", "images": []}, {"floor": 14, "author": "时间到，开饭", "uid": "693492", "avatar": "", "date": "", "html": "倒数第二张这种露一半的太有感觉了，有种想马上拔下来的冲动", "images": []}, {"floor": 15, "author": "star828", "uid": "622660", "avatar": "", "date": "共 13 頁", "html": "极品身材了算。关键是，长得不胖，没有那种肥硕的感觉，可以说是丰韵，好啊，好", "images": []}]};
